The campaign went from container-ready to the correctness gate to the first measured run without an unloaded-to-loaded idle interval. R-06-1 requires B1-pre or an explicit justification: B0 (unloaded, before) and B1-post (loaded, after) were captured and their GPU power medians differ by 1.4%, so no ambient drift is being inferred from a missing baseline; nothing in this campaign's claims depends on a loaded-idle subtraction.
